# Code owners for stellar-upshift-vault-contracts
#
# Owners are requested for review on every PR. Branch protection on `main`
# requires an approving review from a code owner, enforced for admins too,
# and the most recent push must be approved by someone other than its pusher.
#
# Ownership is held by a team (@upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners),
# so on/offboarding is a team membership change, not a commit here. The team
# needs Write access for this file to be valid.
#
# Rules: the LAST matching pattern wins, so `*` stays first. Any one owner
# listed on a line can approve; CODEOWNERS cannot require two approvals.
#
# The sections below are the paths that decide what runs on chain or how it
# is released. They all map to the same team today; they are listed
# explicitly so a dedicated reviewer (e.g. a security team or auditor
# contact) can be added to exactly those lines later.

*                                   @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners

# --- Bytecode-determining: a change here alters the deployed WASM / its hash ---
/contracts/*/src/                   @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/contracts/*/Cargo.toml             @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/Cargo.toml                         @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/Cargo.lock                         @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/rust-toolchain.toml                @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners

# --- Approved artifacts: what CI and the mainnet monitor treat as trusted ---
/reproducible-hashes.txt            @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/interfaces/                        @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/deployments/                       @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners

# --- Release, CI and deploy path ---
/.github/                           @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/deny.toml                          @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/scripts/deploy*.sh                 @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/scripts/upgrade.sh                 @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
/VERIFY.md                          @upshift-protocol/stellar-contracts-owners
